warning BYN5014: `embed` is not a known verb, noun or adjective

  19 │     void embed(ref this) { n += 1 }
     │          ^^^^^
     │
  help: add it to `grammar` in package.byn: `verbs: ["embed"]`, `nouns: ["embed"]` or
        `adjectives: ["embed"]`

error BYN5002: `isSorted` reads as state but modifies `this`

  21 │     void isSorted(ref this) { n += 1 }
     │          ^^^^^^^^ declared `ref this`
     │
  help: remove `ref this` so it only reads, or name the action with a verb
